# wip437: the FACTORY SETTINGS (GLO list) of a fresh unit / a factory reset:
# CLOCK OUT off, NOTES OUT off, TONIC MIDI CH 10, REMOTE MIDI CH off, CC MODE off, CC CH BASE 1-8, OUTPUT LOUD,
# USB AUDIO FOLLOWS KNOB, 4/4 LED on, theme TONIC, ZOOM KNOB yes, AUTOSAVE off, NAME PROJECTS generate,
# TONIC ENGINE enhanced, 2ND CORE on.
wait 300
expect d_clkout 0
expect d_notesout 0
expect d_tonicch 10
expect d_remch 0
expect ccmode 0
expect ccbase 0
expect d_outloud 1
expect d_usbfull 0
expect d_beatoff 0
expect d_palette 5
expect d_zoomoff 0
expect d_autosaveoff 1
expect d_namemanual 0
expect classic 0
expect d_onecore 0
